window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Falcon Falls Security Series Box Set includes the following three military romantic suspense titles:</p> <p>The Hunted One:</p> <p>Will this growly protector break her book-loving heart . . . or become her second chance at love?</p> <p>The Broken One:</p> <p>Fake marry her brother’s best friend to catch a killer . . . sure, what could go wrong?</p> <p>The Guarded One:</p> <p>He’s a grumpy small-town sheriff. And she’s the off-limits operator capable of bringing him to his knees...</p>"; 
